WEBVTT

00:00:10.830 --> 00:00:13.080
"To Aku & Luna: I'm heading to the Holy Capital but
I'll be back by nightfall, so behave and wait here for me.
Don't come and try to look for me there. That means you,
Luna. It would only cause more trouble. - Hakuto Kunai"

00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:17.410
"Hakuto Kunai"

00:00:18.950 --> 00:00:20.370
"Aku"

00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:26.620
Demon Lord... The hot spring
makes my skin... so smooth.

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:30.370
"Luna Elegant"

00:00:30.370 --> 00:00:33.250
My butt is... so smooth.

00:00:36.370 --> 00:00:39.410
Lately, it's been so hectic and busy.

00:00:39.410 --> 00:00:44.410
But since I left a note behind,
I can finally spread my wings and explore.

00:00:44.410 --> 00:00:47.120
--Oh my, how wonderful!
--He's so handsome!

00:00:52.410 --> 00:00:53.370
"Mikan" "Yukikaze"

00:00:53.370 --> 00:00:55.910
"Mikan" "Yukikaze"
I had a dream about the old man last night.

00:00:55.910 --> 00:00:57.660
He's so manly!

00:00:57.660 --> 00:00:59.290
Again?

00:00:59.290 --> 00:01:03.950
I honestly don't know how to react
when you tell me that every time.

00:01:05.250 --> 00:01:10.620
Even after waking up,
my butt still burns like a fire!

00:01:10.620 --> 00:01:13.500
Gimme a break! It's too early for this!

00:01:18.790 --> 00:01:21.290
Hey! W-Wait, Yukikaze!

00:01:21.290 --> 00:01:22.370
Old man!

00:01:27.790 --> 00:01:29.410
We finally meet again!

00:01:33.290 --> 00:01:37.790
<i>Open your eyes</i>

00:01:41.040 --> 00:01:44.330
<i>Dwelling in the eyes of</i>
<i>that majestic figure are wishes</i>

00:01:44.330 --> 00:01:47.910
<i>Let's sing to the sleepless night</i>

00:01:47.910 --> 00:01:51.200
<i>Dramatically pull everything in,</i>
<i>even light and darkness</i>

00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:54.660
<i>In order to smile again tomorrow, unafraid</i>

00:01:56.540 --> 00:02:03.450
<i>I learned that true kindness is</i>
<i>actually solitude after looking at you</i>

00:02:03.450 --> 00:02:09.950
<i>I wanted to get closer to your heart</i>
<i>and yet it's still so far away</i>

00:02:09.950 --> 00:02:16.790
<i>No matter what fate gets in my way,</i>
<i>I'll face it head on</i>

00:02:16.790 --> 00:02:24.040
<i>With the bravery I chose with you,</i>
<i>let's flap our wings and fly</i>

00:02:25.950 --> 00:02:29.330
<i>My heart is trembling with the hope that I found</i>

00:02:29.330 --> 00:02:32.790
<i>Resounding inside me</i>
<i>move my heart</i>

00:02:32.790 --> 00:02:36.250
<i>Lurking behind my hidden true motives</i>

00:02:36.250 --> 00:02:39.700
<i>With a stronger gaze than anyone else</i>

00:02:39.700 --> 00:02:43.000
<i>Dwelling in the eyes of</i>
<i>that majestic figure are wishes</i>

00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:46.620
<i>Let's sing to the sleepless night</i>

00:02:46.620 --> 00:02:49.790
<i>Dramatically pull everything in,</i>
<i>even light and darkness</i>

00:02:49.790 --> 00:02:53.370
<i>In order to smile again tomorrow, unafraid</i>

00:02:53.370 --> 00:02:55.000
<i>Let's begin</i>

00:02:55.000 --> 00:02:57.000
<i>Open your eyes</i>

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:05.000
"Yukikaze Attacks"

00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:11.870
Huh? No way, Demon Lord?! R-Really?

00:03:11.870 --> 00:03:13.910
Oh? It's been a while.

00:03:15.120 --> 00:03:17.910
Although I made it sound like we're old friends,

00:03:17.910 --> 00:03:20.450
I can't remember their names for the life of me.

00:03:20.450 --> 00:03:24.790
It's been so crazy lately
that it's understandable, but...

00:03:24.790 --> 00:03:29.250
It's too bad this world doesn't
have name cards or anything.

00:03:29.250 --> 00:03:32.580
Hmm? Name cards, huh?

00:03:32.580 --> 00:03:35.370
Those actually might catch on here.

00:03:35.370 --> 00:03:37.830
It might work out good for Rabby...

00:03:37.830 --> 00:03:41.790
...considering how sad it is
they're only famous for carrots.

00:03:41.790 --> 00:03:44.620
Um, where have you been, old man?

00:03:44.620 --> 00:03:47.290
Hmm? Oh...

00:03:47.290 --> 00:03:52.160
I've set up base in Rabby Village
and we're working to revamp it.

00:03:52.160 --> 00:03:56.750
Oh, really? Then the rumor was true after all.

00:03:56.750 --> 00:03:58.870
Then what brings you here?

00:03:58.870 --> 00:04:02.330
I need to ask the Adventurer's Guild
a couple of things.

00:04:02.330 --> 00:04:05.040
The Guild? What do you want to know?

00:04:05.040 --> 00:04:08.580
Well, regarding the dungeons up in the north...

00:04:08.580 --> 00:04:13.410
I actually want to ask about items
that ward against magic, but...

00:04:13.410 --> 00:04:18.950
The Guild won't be able to tell you much
about things outside the country.

00:04:18.950 --> 00:04:21.290
But I can teach you! Leave it to me!

00:04:21.290 --> 00:04:23.080
Wh-What?! Yukikaze!

00:04:23.080 --> 00:04:26.870
Don't just say things willy-nilly!
You're talking to the Demon Lord!

00:04:26.870 --> 00:04:32.250
Then why don't you go home, sit in a corner,
and turn into frozen Mikan?

00:04:32.250 --> 00:04:36.000
Who you calling frozen Mikan?!
And why should I sit in the corner?!

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:38.700
--At least let me sit in the center of the room!
--I see... So these two were
Yukikaze and Mikan, huh?

00:04:38.700 --> 00:04:40.540
--Does it even matter, frozen Mikan?
--I see... So these two were
Yukikaze and Mikan, huh?

00:04:40.540 --> 00:04:42.950
--Stop calling me that, idiot!
--That shouldn't be so hard to remember.

00:04:42.950 --> 00:04:47.370
I think I'll give this tag-team
the nickname Yukimikan.

00:04:47.370 --> 00:04:52.370
Anyways, old man...
There's a favorite place of mine nearby.

00:04:52.370 --> 00:04:55.660
I want to treat you as thanks
for all you've done.

00:04:55.660 --> 00:05:00.870
I believe I told you before.
There's no need to pay me back.

00:05:03.370 --> 00:05:07.410
Yes... You said it was important for you too.

00:05:07.410 --> 00:05:08.830
That's right.

00:05:10.450 --> 00:05:14.370
She's really got such pure white skin...

00:05:14.370 --> 00:05:18.830
It makes her seem so mystical,
like fallen snow that never melts.

00:05:19.870 --> 00:05:23.580
It may not be lunch yet,
but you can drink there any time!

00:05:23.580 --> 00:05:25.040
Drink, huh?

00:05:26.040 --> 00:05:27.700
Gulp!

00:05:27.700 --> 00:05:30.370
It's been a while since I craved a drink.

00:05:30.370 --> 00:05:35.500
I've hardly had a moment
of peace to myself lately.

00:05:35.500 --> 00:05:37.040
It's this way!

00:05:37.040 --> 00:05:39.000
I'll follow you from behind.

00:05:39.000 --> 00:05:42.500
We're not kids anymore,
so we don't need to hold hands.

00:05:43.660 --> 00:05:47.370
Please. If you don't... I'll get lost.

00:05:47.370 --> 00:05:48.950
You will?!

00:05:48.950 --> 00:05:51.250
That was close!

00:05:51.250 --> 00:05:54.950
I almost shouted that out on instinct!

00:05:54.950 --> 00:06:00.790
She looks like the type of girl that
quietly reads books at the library, but...

00:06:00.790 --> 00:06:02.950
...she's a huge airhead?

00:06:02.950 --> 00:06:05.250
Mikan, lead the way.

00:06:05.250 --> 00:06:07.370
Fine then, sheesh!

00:06:07.370 --> 00:06:11.250
I've just gotta take you there, right?
What a crummy day...

00:06:11.250 --> 00:06:16.830
This Mikan girl, on the other hand,
doesn't seem to care for me much.

00:06:16.830 --> 00:06:21.580
Then again, with a name like Demon Lord,
I shouldn't expect to be liked.

00:06:21.580 --> 00:06:26.500
I've just got to put up with it until
business in Rabby Village takes off.

00:06:27.370 --> 00:06:30.910
Maze of affection. Labyrinth Love.

00:06:30.910 --> 00:06:33.200
What in the world is she talking about?

00:06:33.750 --> 00:06:35.700
"Bar"
"Noma Noma"

00:06:35.950 --> 00:06:39.950
Owner, three ales! We brought you a customer!

00:06:39.950 --> 00:06:42.500
Oh, if it isn't Mikan!

00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:46.290
It's not very often that
you bring along a-- Huh?

00:06:46.290 --> 00:06:49.540
Hmm? Does she know me from somewhere?

00:06:49.540 --> 00:06:52.790
I wonder if she got involved
in the chaos the other day...

00:06:52.790 --> 00:06:56.660
"Iei"
It's the Demon Lord everyone's
talking about! Nice job, Mikan!

00:06:56.660 --> 00:07:01.290
Oh, was that you? Come here and sit with us!
I'll buy you a beer!

00:07:01.290 --> 00:07:02.870
Huh? Who's that?

00:07:02.870 --> 00:07:07.160
You idiot! He's the one who
blew Carnival into smithereens!

00:07:07.160 --> 00:07:09.830
Hey, go grab the boys for this!

00:07:14.700 --> 00:07:17.080
Old man, come sit over here!

00:07:20.790 --> 00:07:23.120
Thanks for waiting!

00:07:23.120 --> 00:07:27.000
Every shop in the area is grateful
for what you've done.

00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:30.330
Drink as much as you want
since it's on the house today!

00:07:33.120 --> 00:07:37.120
In any case, I might as well
start drinking, then.

00:07:37.120 --> 00:07:38.910
We can talk afterwards.

00:07:42.750 --> 00:07:44.700
What are you doing?

00:07:44.700 --> 00:07:46.580
Helping you drink.

00:07:46.580 --> 00:07:48.660
Is this some hostess bar?!

00:07:48.660 --> 00:07:51.950
What kind of idiot would drink
like this in the morning?!

00:07:51.950 --> 00:07:55.000
Besides, people don't want
to be bothered when they drink...

00:07:55.000 --> 00:07:58.120
...and prefer to help themselves!

00:07:58.120 --> 00:08:00.870
I'm sorry, but let me drink on my own.

00:08:02.450 --> 00:08:03.620
That's too bad.

00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:09.910
This is good.

00:08:09.910 --> 00:08:15.620
Oh, man! This makes all the hard work
these past few days worth it!

00:08:16.950 --> 00:08:21.870
Why is she drinking my ale when she has her own?

00:08:21.870 --> 00:08:24.910
It went so deep... down your throat!

00:08:24.910 --> 00:08:26.750
Quit saying weird stuff!

00:08:26.750 --> 00:08:31.040
Jeez, everything that comes out
of her mouth is ridiculous...

00:08:31.040 --> 00:08:35.200
Indirect kiss. Love is bubblicious.

00:08:35.200 --> 00:08:38.290
Sorry, but could you talk using real words?

00:08:40.200 --> 00:08:43.080
Yukikaze sure never changes.

00:08:43.080 --> 00:08:46.120
Here, I brought you some things to snack on.

00:08:46.120 --> 00:08:47.870
Oh? Let's see...

00:08:51.160 --> 00:08:52.750
It's normal in a good way.

00:08:52.750 --> 00:08:56.950
It's normal?
That's a pretty rude way of putting it!

00:08:56.950 --> 00:08:59.370
Sorry. I mean no offense, but...

00:08:59.370 --> 00:09:05.330
I tried something similar to this in Yahoo,
but it wasn't very good at all.

00:09:05.330 --> 00:09:07.580
Oh, I see what you mean.

00:09:07.580 --> 00:09:11.330
But trying to compare here to there
is a huge mistake.

00:09:13.410 --> 00:09:17.700
I get the feeling that bar owner
is pretty good at what she does.

00:09:19.200 --> 00:09:23.870
Does this girl only eat what people
already put in their mouths?

00:09:23.870 --> 00:09:27.540
The old man's thick stuff... is oozing!

00:09:27.540 --> 00:09:30.080
I told you to quit saying weird stuff!

00:09:30.080 --> 00:09:35.200
Ah, that's the only way Yukikaze
knows how to talk, so give it up.

00:09:38.950 --> 00:09:42.450
Could it be she's not an airhead,
but a total pervert?

00:09:42.450 --> 00:09:46.580
Unless I hurry along the conversation,
I might end up in an infinite loop.

00:09:49.330 --> 00:09:52.620
So, I'd like to get on to the subject already.

00:09:52.620 --> 00:09:53.620
Mmm?

00:09:54.000 --> 00:09:59.000
"Iei" "Race: Human" "Sex: Female"
"Age: 45" "Height: 168cm"

00:09:59.000 --> 00:10:04.000
"Angel White" "Race: Human" "Sex: Female"
"Age: 18" "Height: 165cm"

00:10:05.370 --> 00:10:10.790
I'm unfamiliar with the customs
and adventurer system in this area.

00:10:11.870 --> 00:10:15.120
I honestly don't want to talk
to Demon Lord, but...

00:10:15.120 --> 00:10:20.330
Considering he's saved us twice now,
I guess I have to.

00:10:20.330 --> 00:10:24.080
I'm not sure what to tell you
about the adventurer system.

00:10:24.080 --> 00:10:27.580
I mean, we fight monsters, earn rewards,

00:10:27.580 --> 00:10:31.080
and I guess find treasure in ruins and dungeons?

00:10:33.120 --> 00:10:37.700
The guild accepts various requests,
tasks them to the adventurers,

00:10:37.700 --> 00:10:39.910
and receives a finder's fee.

00:10:39.910 --> 00:10:45.870
Also, adventurers take parts off monsters
and sell them to the guild.

00:10:45.870 --> 00:10:49.290
The nicer the part is, the more it sells for.

00:10:49.290 --> 00:10:52.330
There's also rankings given to adventurers.

00:10:52.330 --> 00:10:58.450
Yeah. The higher your rank,
the better terms and treatment you get.

00:10:58.450 --> 00:11:02.750
Guilds with skilled adventurers
make out like a bandit.

00:11:02.750 --> 00:11:06.040
That's why guilds always compete for them.

00:11:06.040 --> 00:11:09.410
That seems pretty similar
to professional sports players.

00:11:09.410 --> 00:11:13.790
If you're good enough,
teams scout you and offer tons of money.

00:11:13.790 --> 00:11:17.410
They good players can pick
whichever team gives the best offer.

00:11:18.750 --> 00:11:21.790
When money is short,
some become mercenaries too.

00:11:21.790 --> 00:11:23.910
Mercenaries, huh?

00:11:23.910 --> 00:11:28.500
For those not skilled enough,
you do whatever it takes to get by.

00:11:28.500 --> 00:11:33.200
In that way, this world
isn't so different than mine.

00:11:33.200 --> 00:11:37.750
Sometimes monsters are hard
to come by, even in dungeons.

00:11:37.750 --> 00:11:41.370
Well, it doesn't exactly
sound like a stable job.

00:11:41.370 --> 00:11:43.660
They're not office workers, after all.

00:11:43.660 --> 00:11:48.580
It's not like they can count on
a monthly salary or any kind of bonus.

00:11:48.580 --> 00:11:53.120
They're basically self-employed
workers who put their life on the line.

00:11:54.290 --> 00:11:58.040
In wartime like this, a lot of people
have nothing to do.

00:11:58.040 --> 00:11:59.700
In wartime?

00:11:59.700 --> 00:12:03.790
When there's war, it's much harder
to get into the northern countries.

00:12:03.790 --> 00:12:06.580
There're spies and agents everywhere.

00:12:06.580 --> 00:12:10.410
By the way you talk,
I take it there's times of peace too.

00:12:10.410 --> 00:12:11.870
Yeah.

00:12:11.870 --> 00:12:17.540
The warring has gone on for so long,
there's profit to be made during peace.

00:12:17.540 --> 00:12:23.040
If there's war all year long, the trades
and the crops might never recover.

00:12:23.040 --> 00:12:25.910
That would ruin everyone in no time.

00:12:25.910 --> 00:12:30.450
I learned more than I was expecting. Thank you.

00:12:30.450 --> 00:12:33.660
If it's you, I'll tell you anything.

00:12:35.410 --> 00:12:38.540
Is it just me, or is she a bit too close?

00:12:38.540 --> 00:12:41.330
This goes beyond being friendly...

00:12:41.330 --> 00:12:47.700
Ahem! So, what kind of items
do people discover in dungeons?

00:12:47.700 --> 00:12:50.540
Um, there's all sorts, but...

00:12:50.540 --> 00:12:53.040
For example, with weapons and armor,

00:12:53.040 --> 00:12:57.160
they can be broken down
into basically five categories.

00:12:57.160 --> 00:13:02.580
Things made from your basic metal
and leather are called "Normal."

00:13:02.580 --> 00:13:08.160
Whereas "Solid" items are made from
monster fangs, pelts, scales, and such.

00:13:08.160 --> 00:13:11.250
But unless you're skilled,
those are tough to make.

00:13:11.250 --> 00:13:16.370
Then you've got "High-End" items
made with special materials or metals.

00:13:16.370 --> 00:13:20.410
Only Dwarves can build those.
It's impossible for a human.

00:13:20.410 --> 00:13:23.370
The next I don't know a whole much about,

00:13:23.370 --> 00:13:27.620
but there are "Uniques" that a handful
of S-Rank adventurers wield.

00:13:27.620 --> 00:13:30.910
Finally, there's items called "Legendaries."

00:13:30.910 --> 00:13:34.290
That's what the Holy Maiden's
hammer and staves are.

00:13:34.290 --> 00:13:36.540
I see...

00:13:36.540 --> 00:13:39.330
For as messed up as she is,
she's still a Holy Maiden.

00:13:41.750 --> 00:13:44.790
We try to find unidentified items too.

00:13:44.790 --> 00:13:46.870
You can name them yourself!

00:13:46.870 --> 00:13:49.660
Oh? That's very intriguing.

00:13:49.660 --> 00:13:54.000
We could think of a nice name
together to give our new baby.

00:13:54.000 --> 00:13:55.500
We're not newlyweds!

00:13:55.500 --> 00:13:58.700
Gah! I couldn't help myself!

00:13:58.700 --> 00:14:01.790
It's no use! I lose my groove around her!

00:14:01.790 --> 00:14:05.080
This friendliness is plain messed up!

00:14:05.080 --> 00:14:08.200
Then again, they've taught me a great deal.

00:14:08.200 --> 00:14:12.160
There's just one more thing I need to confirm...

00:14:12.160 --> 00:14:16.410
Tell me, can you find any
decent items sold at shops?

00:14:16.410 --> 00:14:19.410
Items that you find all over are mass produced.

00:14:19.410 --> 00:14:21.450
They're not very effective.

00:14:21.450 --> 00:14:25.330
Couldn't you get better items
as long as you have the money?

00:14:25.330 --> 00:14:30.450
Like armor strong against magic,
or swords that slice through hard scales?

00:14:30.450 --> 00:14:35.200
To defend against level four and five magic,
it needs to be Unique level.

00:14:35.200 --> 00:14:39.790
But I bet a weapon of yours could
take down any opponent.

00:14:39.790 --> 00:14:41.160
Hmm...

00:14:41.160 --> 00:14:46.290
In any case, I need to go and confirm
all this info with my own eyes.

00:14:46.290 --> 00:14:49.700
Fortunately, the village
preparations are complete...

00:14:49.700 --> 00:14:53.620
...and Tahara can easily take care of the rest.

00:14:53.620 --> 00:14:58.700
Rather, leaving everything to him
will produce better results anyways.

00:14:58.700 --> 00:14:59.870
Achoo!

00:15:01.790 --> 00:15:02.950
"Isami Tahara"

00:15:03.450 --> 00:15:05.040
The north, huh?

00:15:06.200 --> 00:15:08.910
I think I'll have to go there myself.

00:15:10.080 --> 00:15:14.080
Old man... If you're going north,
I want you to take me with you.

00:15:17.580 --> 00:15:18.660
Take you?

00:15:20.750 --> 00:15:25.290
Despite my looks, I'm a B-Rank adventurer.
I'd be helpful.

00:15:25.290 --> 00:15:31.370
It's true, I could use a guide
and someone with experience.

00:15:31.370 --> 00:15:34.750
Yu and Tahara are busy with the village,
so they can't come.

00:15:34.750 --> 00:15:37.870
And bringing the kids along
is out of the question.

00:15:37.870 --> 00:15:41.910
Plus, Tron might be persecuted
if she leaves the village.

00:15:41.910 --> 00:15:46.750
All right. If it's not any trouble,
I might take you up on that.

00:15:46.750 --> 00:15:50.080
As with anything, we should learn
from those with experience.

00:15:52.410 --> 00:15:56.120
Leave it to me. You won't regret it.

00:15:56.120 --> 00:15:59.540
Man, she sure says weird things sometimes.

00:15:59.540 --> 00:16:02.910
But can you believe how beautiful a girl she is?

00:16:02.910 --> 00:16:05.450
"Man"
With my evil face and her tagging along,

00:16:05.450 --> 00:16:08.450
"Man"
I feel like no one will stop us for inspections.

00:16:09.290 --> 00:16:11.790
If you act now, Mikan will come as an extra.

00:16:11.790 --> 00:16:16.620
Don't add me to the party on your own!
And who are you calling an extra?!

00:16:16.620 --> 00:16:18.950
Mmm. I'm counting on you too.

00:16:18.950 --> 00:16:22.750
Don't count on me!
You two can go all the way there alone!

00:16:22.750 --> 00:16:26.790
Go all the way?
Mikan, you're such a naughty one.

00:16:26.790 --> 00:16:30.410
Argh! Would you just shut up?!

00:16:34.040 --> 00:16:37.290
I cannot put this off a moment longer.

00:16:37.290 --> 00:16:38.870
"Angel White"
O Seraph,

00:16:38.870 --> 00:16:43.830
"Angel White"
I must take the sacred Omega Staff into my possession.

00:16:43.830 --> 00:16:45.830
Please, forgive me.

00:16:49.870 --> 00:16:53.540
I need one of the miracles
the Omega Staff makes possible.

00:16:53.540 --> 00:16:56.750
Instant Movement within
the Kingdom of Holy Light.

00:16:56.750 --> 00:16:59.950
All the magic in this staff will be consumed...

00:16:59.950 --> 00:17:03.250
...and used to bolster my magical power.

00:17:03.250 --> 00:17:08.540
With the magic circle in this room,
the miracle can at last be employed.

00:17:08.540 --> 00:17:11.660
O Seraph, please give me power...

00:17:13.370 --> 00:17:15.200
I must rescue her.

00:17:15.200 --> 00:17:20.250
Not just because she's a Holy Maiden,
but because she's my precious sister Luna as well.

00:17:20.250 --> 00:17:23.160
Whether I must fight or negotiate with him,

00:17:23.160 --> 00:17:28.660
as long as she remains his hostage,
I won't have the freedom to act.

00:17:28.660 --> 00:17:31.870
Demon Lord, I won't let you do as you please.

00:17:33.370 --> 00:17:34.950
Seraph's Bound!

00:17:41.700 --> 00:17:42.700
Huh?

00:17:54.080 --> 00:18:03.000
I didn't... screw it up, did I?

00:18:03.000 --> 00:18:04.040
Hmm?

00:18:04.040 --> 00:18:05.660
Hey, you lady there!

00:18:05.660 --> 00:18:07.830
Uh, yes?

00:18:07.830 --> 00:18:12.160
Are you the one we asked for
that can use "Light" magic or something?

00:18:12.160 --> 00:18:14.080
Those magic crystals are all you.

00:18:14.080 --> 00:18:15.580
H-Huh?

00:18:15.580 --> 00:18:17.830
What are you standing around for?

00:18:17.830 --> 00:18:21.660
And who shows up to do work
wearing a white dress like that?

00:18:21.660 --> 00:18:24.040
You think work is that easy?

00:18:24.040 --> 00:18:26.250
This ain't some ball, you know.

00:18:26.250 --> 00:18:29.080
H-Huh?

00:18:29.080 --> 00:18:30.330
Get on with it!

00:18:30.330 --> 00:18:31.410
R-Right!

00:18:40.950 --> 00:18:43.040
Why am I even doing this?

00:18:43.040 --> 00:18:46.000
And who was that rude man anyways?

00:18:46.000 --> 00:18:48.580
Sister!

00:18:48.580 --> 00:18:50.200
Why are you here?

00:18:50.200 --> 00:18:51.620
Luna!

00:18:51.620 --> 00:18:54.250
Luna, we have to leave.

00:18:54.250 --> 00:18:57.330
You're being tricked by that Demon Lord.

00:18:57.330 --> 00:19:01.200
Huh? What in the world are you talking about?

00:19:01.200 --> 00:19:05.410
Oh! Check this out, Sis! Aren't they so big?

00:19:05.410 --> 00:19:08.500
Is this any time to be bragging about carrots?

00:19:08.500 --> 00:19:10.660
Let's hurry back to the Holy Castle.

00:19:10.660 --> 00:19:13.620
Hurry back? I don't think so!

00:19:13.620 --> 00:19:16.660
I'm kinda busy revamping my territory!

00:19:16.660 --> 00:19:20.200
And you know, it's such a monstrous undertaking!

00:19:20.200 --> 00:19:21.950
Monstrous?

00:19:25.410 --> 00:19:31.330
Is he planning to use this village
as a base to gather a horde of monsters?

00:19:31.330 --> 00:19:37.080
In the first place, how did he get
the money for such a large operation?

00:19:37.080 --> 00:19:42.160
I heard he sold a holy coin or something,
but I'm not exactly sure.

00:19:42.160 --> 00:19:44.540
A-A sacred, holy coin?

00:19:44.540 --> 00:19:47.660
Luna, they're calling for you over there.

00:19:47.660 --> 00:19:50.200
Again? What is it this time?!

00:19:50.200 --> 00:19:53.330
"Tron"
There's a big boulder blocking the way.

00:19:53.330 --> 00:19:54.910
"Tron"
Break it with your goldie.

00:19:55.200 --> 00:19:57.250
There's really no helping it!

00:19:57.250 --> 00:20:01.700
Without me around,
no one can accomplish anything!

00:20:01.700 --> 00:20:03.790
Hurry up and come.

00:20:03.790 --> 00:20:06.830
Hold up! Quit pulling my clothes!

00:20:06.830 --> 00:20:09.330
I'll talk to you later, Sis!

00:20:09.330 --> 00:20:13.580
Kyon, Momo! Could you show
my sister to the hot springs?!

00:20:13.580 --> 00:20:18.330
There's no doubt about it.
That girl has Devil blood.

00:20:18.330 --> 00:20:20.700
She's a despicable "Devil."

00:20:20.700 --> 00:20:22.700
"Kyon" "Momo"
We'll guide you there, hop!

00:20:25.000 --> 00:20:28.250
Luna's already been bewitched to this extent...

00:20:30.870 --> 00:20:35.910
Miss Luna will come a bit later,
but feel free to bathe without her, bunny.

00:20:35.910 --> 00:20:37.040
Bathe?

00:20:39.790 --> 00:20:44.870
Use the changing room just inside
to undress before you bathe, bunny.

00:20:48.700 --> 00:20:49.500
I think the only way to free Luna
is to topple the Demon Lord.

00:20:49.500 --> 00:20:52.910
"Men's Bath"
I think the only way to free Luna
is to topple the Demon Lord.

00:20:52.910 --> 00:20:55.500
In any case, why a bath?

00:21:02.750 --> 00:21:07.250
I suppose a bath is an appropriate
place to find out the bare truth.

00:21:07.250 --> 00:21:10.790
This may end up being my
final chance to persuade Luna.

00:21:18.370 --> 00:21:20.410
This is...?

00:21:20.410 --> 00:21:23.200
These... are all baths?

00:21:23.200 --> 00:21:24.450
All of them?!

00:21:26.330 --> 00:21:30.410
Luna... I mean, what is the Demon Lord thinking?

00:21:31.580 --> 00:21:34.370
Huh? That's...

00:21:40.580 --> 00:21:43.660
There's more baths... outside?

00:21:59.000 --> 00:22:01.700
<i>"I wish I could go back"</i>

00:22:01.700 --> 00:22:04.410
<i>Is what someone said</i>

00:22:04.410 --> 00:22:09.200
<i>But I don't have a past</i>

00:22:09.200 --> 00:22:12.200
<i>For eternity</i>

00:22:12.200 --> 00:22:14.700
<i>That nothing would change</i>

00:22:14.700 --> 00:22:19.450
<i>Is what I thought</i>

00:22:19.450 --> 00:22:22.250
<i>Over and over </i>

00:22:22.250 --> 00:22:25.580
<i>Rubbing my eyes to make sure</i>

00:22:25.580 --> 00:22:29.660
<i>I'm overwhelmed by emotion</i>

00:22:29.660 --> 00:22:32.910
<i>Like a lie</i>
<i>Bright! Still locked up</i>

00:22:32.910 --> 00:22:35.790
<i>Hiding what I couldn't give up</i>

00:22:35.790 --> 00:22:39.950
<i>That miracle lit up by my heart</i>

00:22:39.950 --> 00:22:43.160
<i>Not sought out, not doubted</i>

00:22:43.160 --> 00:22:46.120
<i>But still you believed</i>

00:22:46.120 --> 00:22:50.540
<i>As if to teach me</i>

00:22:50.540 --> 00:22:56.370
<i>RE NEW ME</i>
<i>Now that I'm laughing with you</i>

00:22:56.370 --> 00:23:03.290
<i>I can embrace it all</i>

00:23:03.290 --> 00:23:09.040
<i>Once again</i>

00:23:17.750 --> 00:23:22.000
I reach out my hand and brush aside
the bangs on Aku's face.

00:23:22.000 --> 00:23:23.370
Demon Lord?

00:23:23.370 --> 00:23:26.370
Yes... Your eyes are as pretty as ever.

00:23:26.370 --> 00:23:29.620
I-I don't really like my eyes though.

00:23:29.620 --> 00:23:33.250
But I do. Looking at them calms me down.

00:23:35.330 --> 00:23:41.330
Though her eyes reflect two different colors,
it doesn't bother me at all.

00:23:41.330 --> 00:23:46.790
Next time: <i>Demon Lord, Retry </i>Episode 12.
"White Angel and Demon Lord."
